eachable-states\">73-df-dfa-reachable-states</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.4, print pp. 155–165; PDF pp. 177–187; local quotient/finite-index formulation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§3.4, pp. 67–71; scans 75–79"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[p]_M\">\\([p]_M\\)</span> 与可达集分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5dbd0808feb9e49\" href=\"?note=f5dbd0808feb9e49\" title=\"73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability\">73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3195083cbda04d6c\" href=\"?note=3195083cbda04d6c\" title=\"73-df-dfa-reachable-states\">73-df-dfa-reachable-states</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in Q_{\\min},a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(C\\in Q_{\\min},a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\nQ_{\\min}\\coloneqq\\{[p]_M:p\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\},\\qquad F_{\\min}\\coloneqq\\{[p]_M:p\\in F\\cap\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\nQ_{\\min}\\coloneqq\\{[p]_M:p\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\},\\qquad F_{\\min}\\coloneqq\\{[p]_M:p\\in F\\cap\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\delta_{\\min}\\coloneqq\\{((C,a),D)\\in(Q_{\\min}\\times\\Sigma)\\times Q_{\\min}:\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\;(C=[p]_M\\land D=[\\delta(p,a)]_M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\delta_{\\min}\\coloneqq\\{((C,a),D)\\in(Q_{\\min}\\times\\Sigma)\\times Q_{\\min}:\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\;(C=[p]_M\\land D=[\\delta(p,a)]_M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Min}(M)\\coloneqq(Q_{\\min},\\Sigma,\\delta_{\\min},[q_0]_M,F_{\\min}),\\qquad\\delta_{\\min}:Q_{\\min}\\times\\Sigma\\to Q_{\\min}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Min}(M)\\coloneqq(Q_{\\min},\\Sigma,\\delta_{\\min},[q_0]_M,F_{\\min}),\\qquad\\delta_{\\min}:Q_{\\min}\\times\\Sigma\\to Q_{\\min}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 p∼q，则对任意字母 a 及后缀 z，p 和 q 在 az 上的接受状态相同，所以 δ(p,a)∼δ(q,a)。因此转移与代表元选择无关。必须先只保留可达等价类，否则会保留多余的不可达状态。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability","status":"resolved","id":"f5dbd0808feb9e49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-reachable-states","status":"resolved","id":"3195083cbda04d6c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-reachable-states]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability","status":"resolved","id":"f5dbd0808feb9e49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$。$[p]_M$ 与可达集分别见 [[73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability]]、[[73-df-dfa-reachable-states]]；$C\\in Q_{\\min},a\\in\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-reachable-states","status":"resolved","id":"3195083cbda04d6c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$。$[p]_M$ 与可达集分别见 [[73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability]]、[[73-df-dfa-reachable-states]]；$C\\in Q_{\\min},a\\in\\Sigma$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"[p]_M","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in Q_{\\min},a\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\nQ_{\\min}\\coloneqq\\{[p]_M:p\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\},\\qquad F_{\\min}\\coloneqq\\{[p]_M:p\\in F\\cap\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\delta_{\\min}\\coloneqq\\{((C,a),D)\\in(Q_{\\min}\\times\\Sigma)\\times Q_{\\min}:\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\;(C=[p]_M\\land D=[\\delta(p,a)]_M)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Min}(M)\\coloneqq(Q_{\\min},\\Sigma,\\delta_{\\min},[q_0]_M,F_{\\min}),\\qquad\\delta_{\\min}:Q_{\\min}\\times\\Sigma\\to Q_{\\min}","display":true}],"bytes":2082,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-minimization-construction|可达状态的 Nerode 商自动机]]"},{"id":"9b1dba6be30381aa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定字母表 $\\Sigma$。$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$、$N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)$ 是 DFA。$h:Q\\to P$；$\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}$ 与 $\\operatorname{DFAIso}$ 在下式定义。语言、最小化及指数见 [[73-df-dfa-minimization-construction]]、[[73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa]]、[[73-thm-finite-residual-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["f5dbd0808feb9e49","3195083cbda04d6c"]}